<title>USA: Central Garden unit to buy Country Pet.</title>
<headline>Central Garden unit to buy Country Pet.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, Calif. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Garden &amp; Pet Co said Friday its Kenlin Pet Supply subsidiary agreed to acquire Country Pet Supply Supply N.W. Inc, a distributor of pet supplies and pet food products based in Tampa, Fla.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Country Pet Supply has distibution centers in Atlanta, Miami and Tampa that serve Florida, Georgia, Alabama and South Carolina.</p>
<p>The company has yearly sales of about $33 million, according to Central Garden &amp; Pet.</p>
</text>
